  "notes": "The engineering inventory and preservation survey describe a low concrete slab, granite entrance pavilion with seven two-storey aluminum windows, sheltered entrance and steel industrial windows in the wings. The December 2008 Qualla exterior confirms the glazing, flat roofline and entry canopy. Deck and parapet heights are estimated."
